Package: tallyr
Title: Import Form Data from 'Tally'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Ella", "Kaye", , "hello@ellakaye.co.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R interface to the 'Tally' form builder API
    <https://developers.tally.so>. Authenticate with an API key, list
    your forms, and import form submissions as tidy tibbles.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/EllaKaye/tallyr
BugReports: https://github.com/EllaKaye/tallyr/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    cli,
    curl,
    httr2 (>= 1.1.0),
    purrr,
    rlang,
    tibble
Suggests:
    jsonlite,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
